  "content": "\n\n&nbsp;<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aeroblender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faeroblender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/unsupported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"不支持 Fabric\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/AsDEG7smfn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/RazorDevs/Aeroblender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/RazorDevs/Aeroblender/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/documentation/issues_vector.svg\" alt=\"问题反馈\"></a>\n</div>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n  <strong>重要提示：</strong> AeroBlender 已<strong>内置</strong>于 Deep Aether 中。如果您遇到兼容性问题或错误，请检查是否安装了重复版本。\n  <br><br>\n  <h2>❓ 关于</h2>\n</blockquote>\n<strong>AeroBlender</strong> 是一款基于 <strong>TerraBlender</strong> 的库模组，专为将其生物群系处理功能引入 <strong>The Aether</strong> 维度而设计。\n<ul>\n<li>它提供了一个 API，允许开发者以简单且与 The Aether 兼容的方式添加自定义生物群系。</li>\n<li>它是许多 Aether 附加模组的核心，包括 <em>Deep Aether</em> 和 <em>The Aether: Redux</em>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>📋 依赖项</h2>\n请确保您已安装以下依赖项：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Aether</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrablender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>TerraBlender</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/852465/description_cb42f731-7e27-4a85-bd9e-153919b93cba.png\" width=\"40%\" alt=\"加入我们的社区\">\n</div>\n<br>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n有问题、需要支持或想了解开发进展吗？ \n</div>\n<br>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/AsDEG7smfn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sqidgeon.uk/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></div>",
